<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-UEFA INTERTOTO CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UEFA INTERTOTO CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NYON, Switzerland 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of UEFA</p>
<p>Intertoto Cup semifinal, first leg soccer matches played over</p>
<p>the weekend:</p>
<p> SV Hamburg (Germany)     0 Bastia (France)	   1</p>
<p> Ninzhni Nogorod (Russia) 0 Halmstad (Sweden)	 0</p>
<p> Auxerre (France)	   3 Torpedo Moscow (Russia) 0</p>
<p> Istanbulspor (Turkey)    2 Olympique Lyon (France) 1</p>
<p> Dynamo Moscow (Russia)   2 MSV Duisburg (Germany)  2</p>
<p> Cologne (Germany)	  2 Montpellier (France)    1</p>
<p>Second legs to be played July 30.</p>
<p>Two-leg finals scheduled for August 12 and 26.</p>
</text>
